llenges. Hunger, thirst, and radiation levels change in real-time. Learn to hunt, gather, make fires, and cook, all while staying alert for roaming mutants and infected zombies that may attack at any moment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting:</strong> Unlock over a hundred technological recipes. From primitive wooden bows to precision rifles, from simple bandages to modern tools—craft and repair everything needed, experiencing the survival advantages brought by technological progress.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619580/extras/c461b4343c991ada8975baa73e570ae9.poster.avif?t=1779266467\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619580/extras/c461b4343c991ada8975baa73e570ae9.webm?t=1779266467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619580/extras/c461b4343c991ada8975baa73e570ae9.mp4?t=1779266467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Building:</strong> Construct and upgrade your shelter using traps, barricades, electrical equipment, automated turrets, and functional furnishings. Transform a rudimentary refuge into an impregnable steel fortress.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619580/extras/3f8d4fd11589c12fe36a0aee28f6b585.poster.avif?t=1779266467\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619580/extras/3f8d4fd11589c12fe36a0aee28f6b585.webm?t=1779266467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619580/extras/3f8d4fd11589c12fe36a0aee28f6b585.mp4?t=1779266467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat:</strong> Confront dozens of uniquely styled enemies, including humanoid AI, mutated monsters, special zombie bosses, and high-threat mechanical units like tanks and armed helicopters. Access a rich arsenal—pistols, rifles, rocket launchers, explosives—and customize with scopes, tactical flashlights, and other attachments to meet diverse combat needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619580/extras/d44e9a8289ae5702831569595d987dd3.poster.avif?t=1779266467\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619580/extras/d44e9a8289ae5702831569595d987dd3.webm?t=1779266467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619580/extras/d44e9a8289ae5702831569595d987dd3.mp4?t=1779266467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Driving:</strong> Utilize land, sea, and air vehicles. Search for parts to repair derelict vehicles or trade for them at survivor camps. Engage in high-speed chases, transport strategic materials, and swiftly evacuate dangerous zones.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619580/extras/c9bed5b2dd2426d8a3f10d9f02484891.poster.avif?t=1779266467\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619580/extras/c9bed5b2dd2426d8a3f10d9f02484891.webm?t=1779266467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619580/extras/c9bed5b2dd2426d8a3f10d9f02484891.mp4?t=1779266467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farming:</strong> Cultivate various crops in planting boxes and use water and power systems to create automated irrigation setups, ensuring a stable food supply for long-term survival and making your shelter truly self-sufficient.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619580/extras/5b6cf5ba8530bd95d1ac05202ec395f7.poster.avif?t=1779266467\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619580/extras/5b6cf5ba8530bd95d1ac05202ec395f7.webm?t=1779266467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619580/extras/5b6cf5ba8530bd95d1ac05202ec395f7.mp4?t=1779266467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer:</strong> Play solo at your own pace or team up with friends to experience the thrill of survival together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Modes:</strong> Test weapons quickly in the Training Grounds, unleash your creativity in the Building Sandbox, or feel the tension of light survival in Survival Mode. Mod support and even more fun modes will be added over time!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "The Apocalypse is a low-poly sandbox survival shooter combining fast-paced combat with light survival. Scavenge, craft weapons and vehicles, build shelters, and fight zombies and mutants. Play solo or co-op with friends, with Mod support planned for the future.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Korean, Sp